WEBVTT

00:01:57.071 --> 00:02:00.642
(Laughter)

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:05.470
This is what I see from the balcony
of my hermitage in the Himalayas.

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:09.379
It's about two meters by three,
and you are all welcome any time.

00:02:09.403 --> 00:02:11.611
(Laughter)

00:02:11.635 --> 00:02:15.097
Now, let's come
to happiness or well-being.

00:02:16.621 --> 00:02:20.976
And first of all, you know,
despite what the French intellectuals say,

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:24.430
it seems that no one wakes up
in the morning thinking,

00:02:24.454 --> 00:02:25.976
"May I suffer the whole day?"

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:27.335
(Laughter)

00:02:27.359 --> 00:02:31.976
Which means that somehow,
consciously or not,